### 0. Health check (공개)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/health

### 1. Google login (구글 OIDC ID 토큰으로 로그인/회원가입, 공개)
# idToken은 프론트엔드(Google Identity Services)에서 발급된 실제 ID 토큰으로 교체해야 합니다.
# 응답의 accessToken(JWT)을 전역 변수로 저장해 이후 요청의 Bearer 토큰으로 사용합니다.
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/google
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "idToken": "PASTE_GOOGLE_ID_TOKEN_HERE"
}

> {% client.global.set("accessToken", response.body.data.accessToken); %}

### 2. 현재 사용자 정보 (인증 필요)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 2-1. 내 로그인 이력 (최신순)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login-history
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 2-2. 감지 케이스 목록 (시드 4종)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/cases
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 2-3. 유저 케이스 등록 (MANAGER 이상, 응답에 outMsg 포함)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/user-cases
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "caseId": 1
}

### 2-4. 내 케이스 목록
GET http://localhost:8080/api/user-cases
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 3. Create video source (MANAGER 이상)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/videos
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "type": "UPLOAD",
  "name": "sample-video",
  "sourceUrl": "uploads/sample.mp4"
}

### 4. List video sources (현재 로그인 사용자 기준)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/videos
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 5. Get video source detail
GET http://localhost:8080/api/videos/1
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 6. Update video source (MANAGER 이상)
PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/videos/1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "type": "CCTV",
  "name": "수정된 이름",
  "sourceUrl": "rtsp://example/stream",
  "status": "READY"
}

### 7. Delete video source (soft delete, MANAGER 이상)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/videos/1
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 8. Create analysis job (AI 서버 POST /predict/video 동기 호출, MANAGER 이상)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/analysis/jobs
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "videoSourceId": 1
}

### 9. AI callback (엣지 디바이스가 직접 결과를 전송하는 경우, 공개)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/analysis/callback
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "jobId": 1,
  "status": "DONE",
  "errorMessage": null,
  "events": [
    {
      "eventType": "ABNORMAL",
      "severity": "HIGH",
      "confidenceScore": 0.91,
      "detectedAt": "2026-07-01T12:10:00",
      "snapshotUrl": "uploads/snapshot-1.jpg",
      "clipUrl": "uploads/clip-1.mp4",
      "resultJson": "{\"reason\": \"주변 탐색과 가방 접근이 동시에 감지됨\"}"
    }
  ]
}

### 10. List events (현재 로그인 사용자 기준)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/events
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 11. List alerts
GET http://localhost:8080/api/alerts
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 12. Test alert (MANAGER 이상)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/alerts/test
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 13. Dashboard summary
GET http://localhost:8080/api/dashboard/summary
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 14. Dashboard timeline (날짜별 이벤트 건수)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/dashboard/timeline
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 15. Dashboard severity (심각도별 건수)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/dashboard/severity
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 16. Logout (인증 필요, 무상태 — 클라이언트가 토큰 폐기)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/logout
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
